+// The persistent translation cache (ANAL-381): what's written, what's installed on a later
+// "launch", and what is refused. A launch is pcache::InitForTesting ... ShutdownForTesting with
+// the module mapped afresh (at another address), so records cross a re-link as they would cross
+// processes; the fork tests use real child processes.
+
